        {
          "title": "State",
          "description": "The vault's aggregate ledger. Exactly one per vault. Fee fields mirror\n `yield_vault.ak`'s Stage 5 design: an annual management-fee rate in\n basis points, prorated by wall-clock time, settled by MINTING shares\n to the treasury rather than paying USDr out directly.",
